  "title": "Reinforcement Learning \u2014 LunarLander (Box2D) with PPO",
  "description": "PPO learns to land between the flags with three engines from eight readings (position, speed, angle, leg contact). Needs Box2D: pip install 'ai-made-easy[rl-box2d]'. Around a million steps lands reliably (200 points)."
 },
